        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Revealing Nature — Darwin and Evolution</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100%;\n  background: #efefef;\n}\nbody {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n}\n.page {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 764px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  color: #171717;\n}\n.reading-area {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 43px;\n  top: 95px;\n  width: 455px;\n  height: 338px;\n  background: rgba(239, 239, 239, 0.92);\n}\n.columns {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 207px 217px;\n  column-gap: 20px;\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 52px;\n  top: 101px;\n  width: 434px;\n  font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  font-size: 9.25px;\n  line-height: 12.15px;\n}\n.column {\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n.continuation {\n  margin: 0 0 14px 17px;\n  width: 190px;\n}\n.numbered {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 12px 1fr;\n  column-gap: 5px;\n  margin-bottom: 11px;\n}\n.num {\n  padding-top: 1px;\n  font-size: 8px;\n}\n.text {\n  margin: 0;\n}\nmark {\n  padding: 0;\n  color: inherit;\n  background: rgba(211, 75, 177, 0.48);\n}\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n.note-box {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 5;\n  background: rgba(216, 141, 241, 0.79);\n  color: #111;\n  font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n}\n.top-note {\n  left: 289px;\n  top: 7px;\n  width: 244px;\n  height: 77px;\n  padding: 5px 5px 3px;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  line-height: 16px;\n}\n.bottom-photo.placeholder {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  top: 514px;\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 168px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 9% 95%, #8d6c24 0 3%, transparent 4%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 18% 79%, #c8b879 0 7%, transparent 8%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 27% 91%, #58734c 0 7%, transparent 8%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 44% 75%, #9b8b58 0 8%, transparent 9%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 58% 90%, #4d7055 0 9%, transparent 10%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 73% 74%, #bda76d 0 8%, transparent 9%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 90%, #5b724c 0 11%, transparent 12%),\n    linear-gradient(to bottom, #d9dfd0 0%, #c3c7a8 35%, #718263 72%, #3f5546 100%);\n  filter: saturate(.75);\n}\n.hidden-caption {\n  position: absolute;\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.left-note-one {\n  left: 4px;\n  top: 431px;\n  width: 282px;\n  height: 99px;\n  padding: 4px 5px;\n  font-size: 11.3px;\n  line-height: 15px;\n}\n.left-note-two {\n  left: 4px;\n  top: 531px;\n  width: 282px;\n  height: 145px;\n  padding: 5px 5px;\n  font-size: 11.2px;\n  line-height: 15.7px;\n}\n.right-note {\n  left: 294px;\n  top: 430px;\n  width: 235px;\n  height: 243px;\n  padding: 5px 5px;\n  font-size: 11.2px;\n  line-height: 15.2px;\n}\n.note-box p {\n  margin: 0;\n}\n.arrow {\n  color: #f2dc00;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 15px;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 0 #998900;\n}\n.tabs {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 7;\n  left: 262px;\n  top: 525px;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 8px;\n  background: #0a7a80;\n  border-left: 4px solid #e5d9d5;\n  border-right: 3px solid #3d4545;\n}\n.annotations {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 4;\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 764px;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.footer {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 378px;\n  top: 715px;\n  width: 111px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 8.8px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111;\n}\n.page-no {\n  font-size: 9px;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"reading-area\"></div>\n\n  <section class=\"note-box top-note\">\n    <p>suspect v. 怀疑 n. 被怀疑者；嫌疑犯</p>\n    <p>suspect sb.of (doing) sth.怀疑某人 (干)某事</p>\n    <p>suspect sb.to be... 猜想某人……</p>\n    <p>It was suspected that... 人们怀疑……</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <p class=\"continuation\">\n        their natural environments. After Darwin had<br>\n        spent some time in South America, his room on<br>\n        the ship was crowded with <mark>samples of the plants</mark><br>\n        and animals he had collected. As he studied<br>\n        these, he asked himself the question: how did<br>\n        different species come to exist?\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"numbered\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <p class=\"text\">\n          At that time, people believed that all species<br>\n          had appeared on Earth at the same time, and<br>\n          had not changed since. But Darwin began to<br>\n          think differently. He noticed that some species<br>\n          of animals were very similar to each other.<br>\n          Maybe animals <mark>evolved</mark> as they <mark>adapted</mark> to their<br>\n          changing environments? It was just an idea, but<br>\n          enough to inspire Darwin to look for<br>\n          more evidence.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"numbered\">\n        <div class=\"num\">4</div>\n        <p class=\"text\">\n          When the <em>Beagle</em> reached the Galapagos<br>\n          Islands in 1835, Darwin saw <mark>a variety of</mark> new<br>\n          species, but it was the birds that interested<br>\n          him the most. Darwin noticed that there was<br>\n          a difference between the <mark>finches</mark> on each of<br>\n          the islands. It seemed their <mark>beaks</mark> had evolved<br>\n          according to what food was <mark>available</mark> on that<br>\n          particular island.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <div class=\"numbered\">\n        <div class=\"num\">5</div>\n        <p class=\"text\">\n          Darwin <mark>suspected</mark> that the finches had evolved<br>\n          from a <mark>common ancestor</mark>, which had arrived on<br>\n          the islands a long time before. Over time, it had<br>\n          slowly evolved into many new species. And that<br>\n          was the answer to how new species of plants<br>\n          and animals came to exist: they evolved from<br>\n          earlier ancestors.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"numbered\">\n        <div class=\"num\">6</div>\n        <p class=\"text\">\n          It was a completely new idea – a theory of<br>\n          <mark>evolution</mark>. Darwin explained this theory in his<br>\n          book, <em>On the Origin of Species</em>. It was not<br>\n          published until 1859 and immediately caused<br>\n          a storm. Many people refused to believe the<br>\n          living things, including humans, had evolved<br>\n          from lower forms of life. They were shocked.<br>\n          But Darwin’s scientific studies were so<br>\n          convincing that more and more people started<br>\n          to believe his theory.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"numbered\">\n        <div class=\"num\">7</div>\n        <p class=\"text\">\n          Today, <em>On the Origin of Species</em> is regarded as<br>\n          one of the most important works ever written.<br>\n          It has changed ideas about life on Earth forever.<br>\n          And it all began with the journey on the <em>Beagle</em>.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-photo placeholder\">\n    <span class=\"hidden-caption\">[Photo: natural landscape along the bottom of the page]</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"note-box left-note-one\">\n    <p>adapt vt. 使适应；使适合；改编；改写</p>\n    <p>(1)adapt oneself to sth.使自己适应……</p>\n    <p>adapt to 适应</p>\n    <p>be adapted for... 为……改编/写；被改编成</p>\n    <p>be adapted from... 根据……改编</p>\n    <p>(2)adaptable adj. 能适应的，适应性强的；可改编的</p>\n    <p>adaption/adaptation n. 适应；改编本；改写本</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"tabs\"></div>\n\n  <section class=\"note-box left-note-two\">\n    <p>available adj. 可获得的；可利用的；有空的</p>\n    <p>(1)be available to为……可利用/获得</p>\n    <p>be available from 从……处可获得</p>\n    <p>make sth.available for/to sb. 使某人可以享受某物</p>\n    <p>available resources/facilities&nbsp; 可利用的资源/设备</p>\n    <p>(2)availably adv. 有效地；可获得地</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"note-box right-note\">\n    <p>a variety of 各种各样的</p>\n    <p>(1)variety n. 变化；种类</p>\n    <p>a variety of +n. =varieties of +n.（可数名<br>词复数或不可数名词)各种各样的</p>\n    <p>(2)vary vi. &amp; vt. 有变化；改变</p>\n    <p>vary from...to... 由...到...不等</p>\n    <p>vary between...and...由...到...不等</p>\n    <p>vary with sth.随着...而变化</p>\n    <p>(3)various adj. 各种各样的；多姿多彩的</p>\n    <p class=\"arrow\">↓</p>\n    <p>(1)a variety of/varieties of 后接可数名词作<br>主语时，谓语动词用复数形式；</p>\n    <p>(2)the variety of +复数名词，意为“……的<br>品种”，作主语时，谓语动词用单数形式。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <svg class=\"annotations\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 764\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ca62dc\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\"0.82\">\n      <path d=\"M164 260 C145 319, 88 373, 4 445\"/>\n      <path d=\"M202 277 C248 312, 281 363, 291 445\"/>\n      <path d=\"M198 350 C241 378, 276 411, 292 468\"/>\n      <path d=\"M214 400 C230 427, 245 475, 250 531\"/>\n      <path d=\"M326 106 C346 89, 378 83, 414 81\"/>\n    </g>\n\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d8576b\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.82\">\n      <path d=\"M211 132 q5 -5 9 0 t9 0 t9 0\"/>\n      <path d=\"M214 137 q4 -5 8 0 t8 0\"/>\n      <path d=\"M164 262 q5 -5 10 0 t10 0 t10 0\"/>\n      <path d=\"M200 274 q5 -5 10 0 t10 0\"/>\n      <path d=\"M205 384 q5 -6 10 0 t